    rdfs:comment "used on AdverseEventGroup, AdverseEventReport, ArmGroup, BaselineGroup, BaselineMeasure, FlowGroup, Intervention, OutcomeGroup, OutcomeMeasure, PlannedOutcome, ViolationEvent." .
